<</if>>\
<<if $partyMembers[_i] === "ShadowScythe">>\
<<if $NPCs.ShadowScythe.turnChanceCur >= 0.01>><<if $bonusTurnShadowScythe === true>>EXTRA TURN! <</if>>Select <span class="shadow">ShadowScythe</span>'s attack: <label><<radiobutton "$attackShadowScythe" "Do nothing" checked>> Do nothing</label> | <label><<radiobutton "$attackShadowScythe" "Slash">> <<hovertip `'?s Slash ?dmg 100%?s ?stm 25 ?onhit Inflict <<= $NPCs.ShadowScythe.bleedCountDealt.toFixed(2)>> ?bleed count ?onhit Inflict <<= $NPCs.ShadowScythe.bleedPotencyDealt.toFixed(2)>> ?bleed potency'`>>Slash<</hovertip>></label> | <label><<radiobutton "$attackShadowScythe" "Charge & sweep">> <<hovertip `'?s Charge & sweep ?dmg 100%?s + 50% DEX ?stm 31 ?onhit Inflict <<= ($NPCs.ShadowScythe.bleedCountDealt /1.1).toFixed(2)>> ?bleed count ?onhit Inflict <<= ($NPCs.ShadowScythe.bleedPotencyDealt*1.2).toFixed(2)>> ?bleed potency'`>>Charge & sweep<</hovertip>></label><label><<if $CDPunctureSS >= 1>> | CD: $CDPunctureSS <<hovertip `'?p Puncture ?dmg 125%?p + 5% DEX ?stm 31 ?onhit Inflict <<= $NPCs.ShadowScythe.bleedCountDealt.toFixed(2)>> ?bleed count ?onhit Inflict <<= $NPCs.ShadowScythe.bleedPotencyDealt.toFixed(2)>> ?bleed potency ?onhit Inflict 3 ?defdown count ?onhit Inflict 10 ?defdown potency'`>>Puncture<</hovertip>><<else>> | <<radiobutton "$attackShadowScythe" "Puncture">> <<hovertip `'?p Puncture ?dmg 125%?p + 5% DEX ?stm 31 ?onhit Inflict <<= $NPCs.ShadowScythe.bleedCountDealt.toFixed(2)>> ?bleed count ?onhit Inflict <<= $NPCs.ShadowScythe.bleedPotencyDealt.toFixed(2)>> ?bleed potency ?onhit Inflict 3 ?defdown count ?onhit Inflict 10 ?defdown potency'`>>Puncture<</hovertip>><</if>></label>
<<nobr>>
Choose who <span class="shadow">ShadowScythe</span> attacks: <<for _i = 0; _i lte 99; _i++>>
